="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c452331535-22 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c452331535-22"><span _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="ng-tns-c452331535-22">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c452331535-22"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c452331535-22 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c4287165981="" id="message-content-id-r_84ebbadc652f0c87" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4287165981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_84ebbadc652f0c87" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">在 LangChain 1.1.0（2025年11月稳定版）与 0.3 版本之间，<b>Agent（智能体）的开发模式发生了根本性的范式转移</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">最核心的区别可以用一句话总结：<b>LangChain 1.1.0 彻底抛弃了黑盒式的 <code>AgentExecutor</code>，全面转向了基于图（Graph）的 <code>LangGraph</code> 架构作为默认标准。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="2">以下是具体的开发差异对比和代码实现变化：</p><p data-path-to-node="3"></p><h3>1. 核心架构：Chain vs Graph</h3><p></p><ul data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b>LangChain 0.3 (过渡期):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,1,0,0"><b>主要方式：</b> 使用 <code>AgentExecutor</code> 类。这是一个封装好的“黑盒”循环，很难进行细粒度的控制（比如想在中间步骤人工介入、回滚或修改 Prompt）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,1,1,0"><b>代码特征：</b> 依赖 <code>create_tool_calling_agent</code> 和 <code>AgentExecutor</code>。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0"><b>LangChain 1.1.0 (成熟期):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,0,0"><b>主要方式：</b> 使用 <b>LangGraph</b>。Agent 被建模为一个状态机（State Machine）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,1,0"><b>优势：</b> 循环逻辑是显式的。你可以清楚地看到 LLM 决策 -&gt; 执行工具 -&gt; 更新状态 -&gt; 再次循环的全过程。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,2,0"><b>兼容性：</b> 虽然 1.1.0 可能仍保留 <code>AgentExecutor</code> 以向后兼容，但官方文档和最佳实践已将其标记为 <b>Legacy (过时)</b>。</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="5"></p><h3>2. 代码实现对比</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="6">让我们通过一个简单的“ReAct Agent”（具备工具调用能力的 Agent）来看看代码的差异。</p><p data-path-to-node="7"></p><h4>场景：一个可以使用计算器工具的 Agent</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="8"><b>LangChain 0.3 方式 (基于 AgentExecutor):</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-33 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-33 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_84ebbadc652f0c87&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_46b56aea293e06e4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQgwE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-33 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-33">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-33 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-33 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_84ebbadc652f0c87&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_46b56aea293e06e4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-33"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-33"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-33"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-33"><span class="hljs-comment"># --- LangChain 0.3 ---</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain.agents <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> AgentExecutor, create_tool_calling_agent
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_openai <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatOpenAI
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_core.tools <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> tool
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_core.prompts <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatPromptTemplate

<span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 定义工具 (Pydantic v2 兼容)</span>
<span class="hljs-meta">@tool</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">add</span>(<span class="hljs-params">a: <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>, b: <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span></span>) -&gt; int:</span>
    <span class="hljs-string">"""Adds two numbers."""</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> a + b

tools = [add]
llm = ChatOpenAI(model=<span class="hljs-string">"gpt-4o"</span>)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 创建 Prompt (必须包含 agent_scratchpad)</span>
prompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([
    (<span class="hljs-string">"system"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"You are a helpful assistant."</span>),
    (<span class="hljs-string">"human"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"{input}"</span>),
    (<span class="hljs-string">"placeholder"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"{agent_scratchpad}"</span>), <span class="hljs-comment"># 0.3 的样板代码</span>
])

<span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 构建 Agent 逻辑</span>
agent = create_tool_calling_agent(llm, tools, prompt)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 4. 创建执行器 (黑盒运行)</span>
agent_executor = AgentExecutor(agent=agent, tools=tools, verbose=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 5. 调用</span>
agent_executor.invoke({<span class="hljs-string">"input"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"What is 1 + 1?"</span>})
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="10"><b>LangChain 1.1.0 方式 (基于 LangGraph):</b></p><p data-path-to-node="11">在 1.1.0 中，<code>LangGraph</code> 已经完全集成。对于标准 Agent，我们使用 <code>prebuilt</code>（预构建）方法；对于复杂 Agent，我们定义图。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-34 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-34 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_84ebbadc652f0c87&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_46b56aea293e06e4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhAE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-34 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-34">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-34 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-34 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_84ebbadc652f0c87&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_46b56aea293e06e4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-34"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-34"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-34"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-34"><span class="hljs-comment"># --- LangChain 1.1.0 ---</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langgraph.prebuilt <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> create_react_agent
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_openai <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatOpenAI
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_core.tools <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> tool

<span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 定义工具 (严格的 Pydantic v2 校验)</span>
<span class="hljs-meta">@tool</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">add</span>(<span class="hljs-params">a: <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>, b: <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span></span>) -&gt; int:</span>
    <span class="hljs-string">"""Adds two numbers."""</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> a + b

tools = [add]
llm = ChatOpenAI(model=<span class="hljs-string">"gpt-4o"</span>)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 创建 Agent (不再需要 agent_scratchpad 占位符)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># create_react_agent 自动处理了状态管理和循环逻辑</span>
agent_graph = create_react_agent(llm, tools)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 调用 (基于流式图的调用)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># 输入消息列表，返回最新的状态</span>
messages = agent_graph.invoke({<span class="hljs-string">"messages"</span>: [(<span class="hljs-string">"human"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"What is 1 + 1?"</span>)]})

print(messages[<span class="hljs-string">"messages"</span>][-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>].content)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="13"></p><h3>3. 关键差异点详解</h3><p></p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3151129961="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" class="table-block has-export-button has-scrollbar"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhQE"><table data-path-to-node="14"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="14,0,0,0">特性</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="14,0,1,0">LangChain 0.3 (AgentExecutor)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="14,0,2,0">LangChain 1.1.0 (LangGraph)</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="14,1,0,0"><b>状态管理 (Memory)</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="14,1,1,0">需要手动传递 <code>chat_history</code> 给 <code>AgentExecutor</code>，或者使用 <code>RunnableWithMessageHistory</code> 包装。状态是隐式的。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="14,1,2,0"><b>状态是核心 (Stateful)</b>。Agent 本质上是一个接收 <code>State</code> 并返回更新后 <code>State</code> 的图。持久化通过 Checkpointer 自动处理（如连接 Redis）。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="14,2,0,0"><b>中间干预</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="14,2,1,0">很难。一旦 <code>AgentExecutor.invoke</code> 开始，必须等它跑完。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="14,2,2,0"><b>Human-in-the-loop</b>。你可以设置断点（Interrupt），在 Agent 执行工具前暂停，修改指令，然后继续。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="14,3,0,0"><b>Prompt 结构</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="14,3,1,0">必须在 Prompt 中显式包含 <code>{agent_scratchpad}</code> 来存储中间步骤。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="14,3,2,0">不再需要手动管理 scratchpad。LangGraph 自动将工具调用的结果追加到 <code>messages</code> 列表中。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="14,4,0,0"><b>流式输出</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="14,4,1,0"><code>AgentExecutor</code> 的流式输出非常复杂，很难解析 Token。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="14,4,2,0">原生支持流式事件 (<code>.stream_events</code>)，可以清晰地区分“LLM生成的文本”和“工具执行的输出”。</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy table" aria-label="Copy table" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_84ebbadc652f0c87&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><p data-path-to-node="15"></p><h3>4. Pydantic v2 在 Agent 中的强制性</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="16">在 <b>LangChain 1.1.0</b> 中，Agent 对工具的参数验证变得极其严格：</p><ul data-path-to-node="17"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,0,0"><b>0.3 版本：</b> 如果工具参数定义稍微有点模糊（比如没有 Type Hint），Agent 可能还能勉强运行，或者在运行时报错。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,1,0"><b>1.1.0 版本：</b> 定义 <code>@tool</code> 时，如果不符合 Pydantic v2 标准（例如字段缺少默认值但不是必填项），在<b>定义阶段</b>就会报错。Agent 在决定调用工具前，会进行更严格的 Schema 预校验。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="18"></p><h3>总结建议</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="19">如果您正在开发新项目：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="20"><li><p data-path-to-node="20,0,0"><b>不要使用 <code>AgentExecutor</code></b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="20,1,0">直接学习 <b>LangGraph</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="20,2,0">如果只是简单的“对话+工具”，使用 <code>langgraph.prebuilt.create_react_agent</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="20,3,0">如果是复杂的业务流（比如：如果检索失败则尝试网络搜索，如果还失败则询问人类），使用 <code>StateGraph</code> 自定义图。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="21"><b>下一步：</b>
您目前的项目是倾向于简单的“一问一答+工具调用”，还是需要处理复杂的长流程（例如：多步推理、人工审核步骤）？我可以为您提供相应的 <b>LangGraph 实现模板</b>。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" _nghost-ng-c3206106919="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c623567544-20"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3226180721="" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-28 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3226180721-28 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3226180721-28 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-28"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-28"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163="" class="conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted" id="44f60ebdd75a5b8d" style=""><user-query _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163=