_ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c452331535-52 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c452331535-52"><span _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="ng-tns-c452331535-52">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c452331535-52"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c452331535-52 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c4287165981="" id="message-content-id-r_f0583d655cd6d1e4" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4287165981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_f0583d655cd6d1e4" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">在 <b>LangChain 1.1.0 (LangGraph)</b> 体系中，实现多轮对话记忆（Memory）的方式比以前变得更加简单且强大。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">你不再需要手动维护一个 <code>chat_history</code> 列表或者使用复杂的 <code>ConversationBufferMemory</code> 类。现在的核心概念是 <b>“持久化检查点” (Checkpointing)</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">只需在创建 Agent 时挂载一个 <b>Checkpointer（检查点保存器）</b>，并在调用时指定一个 <b><code>thread_id</code>（会话ID）</b>，LangGraph 就会自动替你保存和加载之前的对话状态。</p><p data-path-to-node="3"></p><h3>代码实现示例</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="4">以下是在上一段代码基础上的升级版。</p><p data-path-to-node="5"></p><h4>1. 引入必要的包</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="6">我们需要引入 <code>MemorySaver</code>，这是官方提供的一个用于在内存中保存状态的类（生产环境可以使用 SQLite 或 Redis 替代）。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-63 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-63 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f0583d655cd6d1e4&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_60c63c4ca0074dac&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrQE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-63 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-63">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-63 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-63 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f0583d655cd6d1e4&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_60c63c4ca0074dac&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-63"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-63"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-63"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-63"><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langgraph.checkpoint.memory <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> MemorySaver <span class="hljs-comment"># 新增引入</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langgraph.prebuilt <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> create_react_agent
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_openai <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatOpenAI
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_core.tools <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> tool

<span class="hljs-comment"># --- 定义工具 (保持不变) ---</span>
<span class="hljs-meta">@tool</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">get_weather</span>(<span class="hljs-params">city: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span></span>) -&gt; str:</span>
    <span class="hljs-string">"""查询指定城市的实时天气。"""</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-string">"北京"</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> city:
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">"北京今天晴转多云，气温 15-25 度。"</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">elif</span> <span class="hljs-string">"上海"</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> city:
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">"上海今天小雨，气温 18-22 度。"</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">f"暂时无法获取 <span class="hljs-subst">{city}</span> 的天气数据。"</span>

tools = [get_weather]
llm = ChatOpenAI(model=<span class="hljs-string">"gpt-4o"</span>, temperature=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)

<span class="hljs-comment"># --- 核心变化 1: 初始化 Checkpointer ---</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># MemorySaver 会把对话状态保存在内存中</span>
memory = MemorySaver()

<span class="hljs-comment"># --- 核心变化 2: 创建 Agent 时传入 checkpointer ---</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># 这样 Agent 就具备了"读写记忆"的能力</span>
agent_executor = create_react_agent(llm, tools, checkpointer=memory)

<span class="hljs-comment"># --- 核心变化 3: 调用时指定 thread_id ---</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># thread_id 就像是用户的"会话ID"。只要 ID 相同，Agent 就会调取之前的记忆。</span>
config = {<span class="hljs-string">"configurable"</span>: {<span class="hljs-string">"thread_id"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"session_user_1"</span>}}

print(<span class="hljs-string">"--- 第一轮对话 ---"</span>)
query1 = <span class="hljs-string">"北京今天天气怎么样？"</span>
response1 = agent_executor.invoke(
    {<span class="hljs-string">"messages"</span>: [(<span class="hljs-string">"user"</span>, query1)]}, 
    config=config  <span class="hljs-comment"># 传入配置</span>
)
print(<span class="hljs-string">f"User: <span class="hljs-subst">{query1}</span>"</span>)
print(<span class="hljs-string">f"AI:   <span class="hljs-subst">{response1[<span class="hljs-string">'messages'</span>][-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>].content}</span>"</span>)

print(<span class="hljs-string">"\n--- 第二轮对话 (测试记忆) ---"</span>)
<span class="hljs-comment"># 注意：用户这里只说了"那上海呢？"，没有重复"天气"这个词。</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># Agent 必须记得上一轮聊的是天气，才能正确调用工具。</span>
query2 = <span class="hljs-string">"那上海呢？"</span> 
response2 = agent_executor.invoke(
    {<span class="hljs-string">"messages"</span>: [(<span class="hljs-string">"user"</span>, query2)]}, 
    config=config  <span class="hljs-comment"># 使用相同的 thread_id</span>
)
print(<span class="hljs-string">f"User: <span class="hljs-subst">{query2}</span>"</span>)
print(<span class="hljs-string">f"AI:   <span class="hljs-subst">{response2[<span class="hljs-string">'messages'</span>][-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>].content}</span>"</span>)

print(<span class="hljs-string">"\n--- 第三轮对话 (开启新会话) ---"</span>)
<span class="hljs-comment"># 如果换一个新的 thread_id，Agent 就会像失忆一样，是一张白纸。</span>
config_new = {<span class="hljs-string">"configurable"</span>: {<span class="hljs-string">"thread_id"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"session_user_2"</span>}}
query3 = <span class="hljs-string">"我刚才问你的第一个城市是哪里？"</span>
response3 = agent_executor.invoke(
    {<span class="hljs-string">"messages"</span>: [(<span class="hljs-string">"user"</span>, query3)]}, 
    config=config_new 
)
print(<span class="hljs-string">f"User (新ID): <span class="hljs-subst">{query3}</span>"</span>)
print(<span class="hljs-string">f"AI   (新ID): <span class="hljs-subst">{response3[<span class="hljs-string">'messages'</span>][-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>].content}</span>"</span>)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="8"></p><h3>关键原理解析</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="9"></p><h4>1. <code>thread_id</code> (线程 ID)</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="10">这是 LangGraph 区别于旧版 LangChain 的一大改进。</p><ul data-path-to-node="11"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0"><b>以前 (0.3/0.2):</b> 你必须把 <code>chat_history</code> 对象（List）传来传去，或者塞进 Prompt 里。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0"><b>现在 (1.1.0):</b> 状态由 LangGraph 托管。你只需要告诉它：“我是 <code>session_user_1</code>”，它就会去数据库里把这个 ID 对应的所有历史状态（State）拉取出来，恢复现场，然后继续执行。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="12"></p><h4>2. <code>MemorySaver</code> vs 生产环境</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="13">上面的代码使用了 <code>MemorySaver</code>，重启程序后记忆会消失。在生产环境中（如 Web 后端），你通常会使用持久化存储，用法完全一样，只是替换类名：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-64 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-64 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f0583d655cd6d1e4&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_60c63c4ca0074dac&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrgE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-64 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-64">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-64 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-64 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f0583d655cd6d1e4&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_60c63c4ca0074dac&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-64"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-64"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-64"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-64"><span class="hljs-comment"># 生产环境示例 (需要安装 langgraph-checkpoint-sqlite)</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> sqlite3
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langgraph.checkpoint.sqlite <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> SqliteSaver

<span class="hljs-comment"># 连接数据库文件</span>
conn = sqlite3.connect(<span class="hljs-string">"chat_history.db"</span>, check_same_thread=<span class="hljs-literal">False</span>)
memory = SqliteSaver(conn)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 创建 Agent</span>
agent_executor = create_react_agent(llm, tools, checkpointer=memory)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="15">这样即使服务器重启，只要 <code>thread_id</code> 不变，用户第二天回来接着聊，Agent 依然记得昨天的内容。</p><p data-path-to-node="16"></p><h3>总结：与 0.3 版本的思维差异</h3><p></p><ul data-path-to-node="17"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,0,0"><b>旧版思维：</b> “我要把历史记录塞进 Prompt 的 <code>{history}</code> 变量里。”</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,1,0"><b>新版思维：</b> “这是一个状态机。我只要提供 <code>thread_id</code>，图（Graph）会自动加载之前的状态（State），把新消息追加进去，然后让 LLM 决定下一步怎么走。”</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="18">这种方式不仅解决了记忆问题，还顺便解决了 <b>“断点续传”</b> 的问题（例如 Agent 运行到一半报错了，你可以从报错的地方继续运行，因为状态都被 Checkpointer 保存了）。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" _nghost-ng-c3206106919="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c623567544-50"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3226180721="" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-58 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3226180721-58 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3226180721-58 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c