></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c4287165981="" id="message-content-id-r_d5fe93e247ee7604" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4287165981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_d5fe93e247ee7604" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">在 LangChain 1.1.0 (LangGraph) 中，给 Agent 配置提示词（Prompt）和强制其进行结构化输出（Structured Output）的方式非常灵活。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">这里有一个关键的思维转变：<b>不要试图强行让 Agent 直接“打印”一段 JSON 字符串，而是将“结构化输出”定义为一个特殊的工具（Tool），强迫 Agent 在最后一步调用它。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="2">以下是完整的实现方案。</p><p data-path-to-node="3"></p><h3>核心概念</h3><p></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b>提示词 (System Prompt):</b> 在 <code>create_react_agent</code> 中，通过 <code>state_modifier</code> 参数直接传入。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0"><b>结构化输出 (Structured Output):</b> 定义一个 Pydantic 模型，将其作为一种“工具”提供给 Agent，并在提示词中要求 Agent <b>必须</b>使用这个工具来提交最终答案。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="5"><p data-path-to-node="6"></p><h3>完整代码示例</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="7">假设场景：我们要创建一个“金融分析助手”，它能查询汇率（模拟），然后生成一份结构化的 JSON 报告。</p><p data-path-to-node="8"></p><h4>1. 准备工作</h4><p></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-81 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-81 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d5fe93e247ee7604&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_8d9bd150252c0944&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQwwE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-81 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-81">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-81 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-81 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d5fe93e247ee7604&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_8d9bd150252c0944&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-81"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-81"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-81"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-81"><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> typing <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> Literal
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_openai <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatOpenAI
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_core.tools <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> tool
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langgraph.prebuilt <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> create_react_agent
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> pydantic <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> BaseModel, Field

<span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 定义最终想要的输出结构 (Pydantic v2)</span>
<span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">FinancialReport</span>(<span class="hljs-params">BaseModel</span>):</span>
    <span class="hljs-string">"""最终的分析报告结构"""</span>
    currency_pair: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span> = Field(description=<span class="hljs-string">"涉及的货币对，例如 USD/CNY"</span>)
    rate: <span class="hljs-built_in">float</span> = Field(description=<span class="hljs-string">"当前汇率值"</span>)
    risk_level: Literal[<span class="hljs-string">"High"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"Medium"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"Low"</span>] = Field(description=<span class="hljs-string">"基于汇率波动的风险等级"</span>)
    advice: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span> = Field(description=<span class="hljs-string">"给投资者的简短建议"</span>)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 定义普通工具 (用于获取信息)</span>
<span class="hljs-meta">@tool</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">get_exchange_rate</span>(<span class="hljs-params">pair: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span></span>) -&gt; str:</span>
    <span class="hljs-string">"""查询货币对的实时汇率。输入格式如 'USD/CNY'。"""</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment"># 模拟数据</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-string">"USD/CNY"</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> pair:
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">"7.25"</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">elif</span> <span class="hljs-string">"EUR/USD"</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> pair:
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">"1.08"</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">"Unknown"</span>

<span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 定义'结构化输出工具'</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># 技巧：这是一个没有任何逻辑的函数，它的唯一作用是告诉 LLM "请按这个格式填表"</span>
<span class="hljs-meta">@tool</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">submit_final_report</span>(<span class="hljs-params">report: FinancialReport</span>):</span>
    <span class="hljs-string">"""
    当收集完所有信息并准备好最终答案时，必须调用此工具来提交报告。
    不要直接在对话中回复文本，必须使用此工具。
    """</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> report

<span class="hljs-comment"># 4. 准备工具列表</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># 注意：我们将 submit_final_report 也放入工具列表中</span>
tools = [get_exchange_rate, submit_final_report]

llm = ChatOpenAI(model=<span class="hljs-string">"gpt-4o"</span>, temperature=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="10"></p><h4>2. 配置提示词与 Agent</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="11">这里使用 <code>state_modifier</code> 来注入 System Prompt。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-82 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-82 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d5fe93e247ee7604&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_8d9bd150252c0944&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQxAE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-82 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-82">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-82 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-82 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d5fe93e247ee7604&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_8d9bd150252c0944&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-82"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-82"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-82"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-82"><span class="hljs-comment"># 5. 定义系统提示词 (System Prompt)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># 关键点：明确指示 Agent 使用 submit_final_report 工具作为结束</span>
system_prompt = <span class="hljs-string">"""
你是一位专业的金融分析师。
你的任务是查询汇率并评估风险。

规则：
1. 先使用查询工具获取数据。
2. 根据汇率判断风险（汇率&gt;7.0视为 High，否则为 Low）。
3. 必须且只能通过调用 'submit_final_report' 工具来结束任务。
4. 不要直接输出文本答案。
"""</span>

<span class="hljs-comment"># 6. 创建 Agent</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># state_modifier 会被添加到消息队列的最前端，充当 System Message</span>
agent_executor = create_react_agent(
    llm, 
    tools, 
    state_modifier=system_prompt
)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="13"></p><h4>3. 执行与结果解析</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="14">由于我们强迫 Agent 调用工具来输出，最终的结果不是在 <code>content</code> 文本里，而是在 <code>tool_calls</code> 里。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-83 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-83 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d5fe93e247ee7604&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_8d9bd150252c0944&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQxQE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-83 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-83">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-83 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-83 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d5fe93e247ee7604&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_8d9bd150252c0944&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-83"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-83"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-83"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-83"><span class="hljs-comment"># 7. 运行 Agent</span>
query = <span class="hljs-string">"帮我分析一下美元兑人民币(USD/CNY)的当前情况"</span>
print(<span class="hljs-string">f"用户指令: <span class="hljs-subst">{query}</span>"</span>)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 运行图</span>
events = agent_executor.invoke({<span class="hljs-string">"messages"</span>: [(<span class="hljs-string">"user"</span>, query)]})

<span class="hljs-comment"># 8. 解析结构化输出</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># 我们查看最后一条消息。如果 Agent 听话，最后一步应该是调用 submit_final_report</span>
last_message = events[<span class="hljs-string">"messages"</span>][-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]

<span class="hljs-comment"># 检查是否有工具调用</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> last_message.tool_calls:
    tool_call = last_message.tool_calls[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>]
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> tool_call[<span class="hljs-string">"name"</span>] == <span class="hljs-string">"submit_final_report"</span>:
        <span class="hljs-comment"># args 已经是被 LangChain 自动解析好的字典</span>
        report_data = tool_call[<span class="hljs-string">"args"</span>]
        
        print(<span class="hljs-string">"\n--- 获取到结构化输出 ---"</span>)
        print(<span class="hljs-string">f"货币对: <span class="hljs-subst">{report_data[<span class="hljs-string">'currency_pair'</span>]}</span>"</span>)
        print(<span class="hljs-string">f"汇率:   <span class="hljs-subst">{report_data[<span class="hljs-string">'rate'</span>]}</span>"</span>)
        print(<span class="hljs-string">f"风险:   <span class="hljs-subst">{report_data[<span class="hljs-string">'risk_level'</span>]}</span>"</span>)
        print(<span class="hljs-string">f"建议:   <span class="hljs-subst">{report_data[<span class="hljs-string">'advice'</span>]}</span>"</span>)
        
        <span class="hljs-comment"># 如果需要转回 Pydantic 对象</span>
        report_obj = FinancialReport(**report_data)
        <span class="hljs-comment"># print(report_obj.json())</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:
        print(<span class="hljs-string">"Agent 调用了其他工具，未结束任务。"</span>)
<span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:
    print(<span class="hljs-string">"Agent 直接返回了文本，未遵循结构化输出指令。"</span>)
    print(<span class="hljs-string">f"回复内容: <span class="hljs-subst">{last_message.content}</span>"</span>)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="16"></p><h3>关键点总结</h3><p></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="17"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,0,0"><b><code>state_modifier</code> = System Prompt:</b>
在 <code>create_react_agent</code> 中，这是修改 Agent 行为、设定人设、注入规则的标准位置。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,1,0"><b>结构化输出即工具调用 (Tool Call):</b>
在 Agent 模式下，不要使用 <code>llm.with_structured_output()</code>，因为这会锁死 LLM 的输出模式，导致它无法调用查询工具（如 <code>get_exchange_rate</code>）。
<b>最佳实践</b>是提供一个 <code>submit_report</code> 工具，并在提示词中规定：“查完资料后，填这张表（调用这个工具）交给我”。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,2,0"><b>Pydantic v2:</b>
LangChain 1.1.0 深度绑定 Pydantic v2。在定义 <code>FinancialReport</code> 时，<code>Field(description="...")</code> 非常重要，因为 LLM 会阅读这个描述来决定填什么内容。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="18"></p><h3>这种方式的好处</h3><p></p><ul data-path-to-node="19"><li><p data-path-to-node="19,0,0"><b>稳定性:</b> 相比于让 LLM 生成 JSON 字符串然后再 <code>json.loads</code>（容易因格式错误崩溃），让 LLM 调用工具是目前大模型能力最强、最稳定的输出方式。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,1,0"><b>思维链:</b> Agent 可以先思考（“我要查汇率” -&gt; 调用查询工具），拿到结果后再思考（“汇率很高，风险是 High” -&gt; 调用提交工具），这比单次调用 LLM 效果好得多。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="20"><b>下一步：</b>
您是否需要让这个 Agent 能够处理<b>文件</b>（比如读取 CSV 或 PDF）作为输入，然后生成结构化报告？</p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" _nghost-ng-c3206106919="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c623567544-65"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3226180721="" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-75 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3226180721-75 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3226180721-75 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-75"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-75"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163="" class="conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted" id="957130801c7f403d" style=""><user-query _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163="" _nghost-ng-c2478830625=""