" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_693)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g></g></svg></div></div></bard-avatar><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c623567544-84 has-thoughts is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" class="menu-button-wrapper ng-tns-c623567544-84 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" mat-button="" mattooltip="More" tabindex="0" aria-label="Show more options" data-test-id="more-menu-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button more-button ng-tns-c623567544-84 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-53" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="response-content ng-tns-c623567544-84"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c452331535="" class="ng-tns-c452331535-85 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c452331535-85 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c452331535-85"><button _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c452331535-85 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c452331535-85"><span _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="ng-tns-c452331535-85">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c452331535-85"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c452331535-85 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c4287165981="" id="message-content-id-r_957130801c7f403d" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4287165981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_957130801c7f403d" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">既然您对结构化输出的机制已经了解，那我们顺势进入下一个非常实用的场景：<b>如何让这个 Agent 读取您的私有文件（如 PDF、TXT、CSV）</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">在 LangChain 1.1.0 中，这被称为 <b>RAG (检索增强生成) 与 Agent 的结合</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">核心变化在于：以前我们可能用 <code>RetrievalQA</code> 链，现在我们通过 <b><code>create_retriever_tool</code></b> 将知识库直接转化成一个“工具”，让 Agent 像使用计算器一样去“查阅资料”。</p><p data-path-to-node="3"></p><h3>场景：构建一个“企业文档问答助手”</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="4">假设您有一个包含公司内部规定的 TXT 文件，您希望 Agent 能根据文件内容回答问题。</p><p data-path-to-node="5"></p><h4>1. 环境准备</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="6">需要安装向量数据库支持（以 FAISS 为例）：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-96 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-96 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_957130801c7f403d&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3e92ce05b6c45457&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ1AE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-96 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-96">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-96 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-96 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_957130801c7f403d&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3e92ce05b6c45457&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-96"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-96"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-96"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-96">pip install faiss-cpu langchain-community
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="8"></p><h4>2. 完整代码实现</h4><p></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-97 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-97 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_957130801c7f403d&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3e92ce05b6c45457&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ1QE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-97 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-97">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-97 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-97 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_957130801c7f403d&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3e92ce05b6c45457&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-97"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-97"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-97"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-97"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> os
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_openai <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatOpenAI, OpenAIEmbeddings
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_community.vectorstores <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> FAISS
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_community.document_loaders <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> TextLoader
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_text_splitters <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> CharacterTextSplitter
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain.tools.retriever <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> create_retriever_tool
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langgraph.prebuilt <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> create_react_agent

<span class="hljs-comment"># --- 第一步：构建知识库 (RAG 标准流程) ---</span>

<span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 模拟一个本地文件 (在实际场景中，您可以读取真实的 txt/pdf)</span>
file_path = <span class="hljs-string">"company_policy.txt"</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">with</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">open</span>(file_path, <span class="hljs-string">"w"</span>, encoding=<span class="hljs-string">"utf-8"</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> f:
    f.write(<span class="hljs-string">"""
    【公司休假规定】
    1. 年假：入职满一年拥有 10 天带薪年假。
    2. 病假：需提供二级以上医院证明，按工资 80% 发放。
    3. 报销：所有差旅发票需在次月 5 号前提交，超过时间不予报销。
    """</span>)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 加载并切分文档</span>
loader = TextLoader(file_path, encoding=<span class="hljs-string">"utf-8"</span>)
documents = loader.load()
text_splitter = CharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=<span class="hljs-number">100</span>, chunk_overlap=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)
docs = text_splitter.split_documents(documents)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 存入向量数据库 (VectorStore)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># 注意：这里需要 OpenAI Key 对应的 Embedding 权限</span>
embeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()
vector_store = FAISS.from_documents(docs, embeddings)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 4. 创建检索器 (Retriever)</span>
retriever = vector_store.as_retriever()


<span class="hljs-comment"># --- 第二步：将检索器转化为工具 (1.1.0 核心) ---</span>

<span class="hljs-comment"># create_retriever_tool 自动把检索器封装成一个符合 Pydantic 标准的 Tool</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># name 和 description 至关重要，Agent 靠它们决定何时去查知识库</span>
retriever_tool = create_retriever_tool(
    retriever,
    name=<span class="hljs-string">"search_company_policy"</span>,
    description=<span class="hljs-string">"当用户询问关于公司休假、报销、福利等规定时，必须使用此工具查询。"</span>
)

tools = [retriever_tool]


<span class="hljs-comment"># --- 第三步：构建并运行 Agent (使用 LangGraph) ---</span>

llm = ChatOpenAI(model=<span class="hljs-string">"gpt-4o"</span>, temperature=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 系统提示词：告诉它要基于查到的内容回答</span>
system_prompt = <span class="hljs-string">"你是一个行政助手。请优先使用 search_company_policy 工具来回答用户的问题。如果工具里没有相关信息，请直接说不知道。"</span>

agent_executor = create_react_agent(
    llm, 
    tools, 
    state_modifier=system_prompt
)

<span class="hljs-comment"># --- 第四步：测试 ---</span>

print(<span class="hljs-string">"--- 测试 1: 询问报销 ---"</span>)
query1 = <span class="hljs-string">"我想问一下发票最晚什么时候交？"</span>
response1 = agent_executor.invoke({<span class="hljs-string">"messages"</span>: [(<span class="hljs-string">"user"</span>, query1)]})
print(<span class="hljs-string">f"AI: <span class="hljs-subst">{response1[<span class="hljs-string">'messages'</span>][-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>].content}</span>"</span>)

print(<span class="hljs-string">"\n--- 测试 2: 询问无关话题 (测试 Agent 判断力) ---"</span>)
<span class="hljs-comment"># 好的 Agent 应该判断出这个问题不需要查文档</span>
query2 = <span class="hljs-string">"1+1等于几？"</span>
response2 = agent_executor.invoke({<span class="hljs-string">"messages"</span>: [(<span class="hljs-string">"user"</span>, query2)]})
print(<span class="hljs-string">f"AI: <span class="hljs-subst">{response2[<span class="hljs-string">'messages'</span>][-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>].content}</span>"</span>)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 清理测试文件</span>
os.remove(file_path)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="10"></p><h3>关键点解析 (1.1.0 vs 旧版)</h3><p></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="11"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0"><b>工具化的 RAG:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="11,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,1,0,0">旧版中，RAG 往往是一个独立的 <code>RetrievalQA</code> Chain。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,1,1,0">在 1.1.0 Agent 体系中，<b>知识库就是一个 Tool</b>。这意味着 Agent 可以混合使用能力：它可以先调用 <code>search_company_policy</code> 查规定，发现规定说“按工资 80% 发放”，然后它还可以调用之前定义的 <code>calculator</code> 工具来算具体的钱数。这种<b>多工具协同</b>是 Agent 的最大魅力。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0"><b><code>create_retriever_tool</code>:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="11,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,1,0,0">这个辅助函数非常重要。它自动处理了“Agent 怎么把自然语言问题转换成检索 query”的逻辑，并封装了输入输出的 Schema。</p></li></ul></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="12"></p><h3>总结</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="13">到现在为止，您已经掌握了 LangChain 1.1.0 (LangGraph) 的三个核心支柱：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="14"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,0,0"><b>逻辑控制:</b> 使用 <code>create_react_agent</code> 替代 <code>AgentExecutor</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,1,0"><b>记忆管理:</b> 使用 <code>checkpointer</code> 和 <code>thread_id</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,0"><b>能力扩展:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="14,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,1,0,0"><b>查外部:</b> 编写自定义 Python 函数 (<code>@tool</code>)。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,1,1,0"><b>查内部:</b> 将向量库转化为工具 (<code>create_retriever_tool</code>)。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,1,2,0"><b>定规矩:</b> 使用 <code>state_modifier</code> 注入 Prompt 和结构化输出要求。</p></li></ul></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="15"><b>下一步：</b>
您现在的 Agent 是跑在 Python 脚本里的。
<b>您是否需要将这个 Agent 部署成 API 服务（例如 REST API），让您的前端应用（ExtJS）或其他系统能够调用它？</b> 我们可以讨论 <b>LangServe</b>。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="response-footer has-thoughts is-mobile gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" _nghost-ng-c3206106919="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c623567544-84"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3226180721="" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-91 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3226180721-91 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3226180721-91 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-91"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-91"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163="" class="conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted" id="353a5703faa39fda" style=""><user-query _ngcontent-ng-c25