ghts ng-tns-c452331535-99 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c452331535-99"><button _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c452331535-99 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c452331535-99"><span _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="ng-tns-c452331535-99">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c452331535-99"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c452331535-99 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c4287165981="" id="message-content-id-r_353a5703faa39fda" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4287165981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_353a5703faa39fda" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">将 LangChain 1.1.0 (LangGraph) 的 Agent 部署为 API 服务，官方推荐的解决方案是 <b>LangServe</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">LangServe 专门为 LangChain 设计，它能自动帮你处理很多繁琐的事情：</p><ul data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b>自动生成 REST API 接口</b>（支持 <code>/invoke</code>, <code>/stream</code>, <code>/batch</code> 等）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b>自动生成 Swagger 文档</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><b>自带调试 Playground</b>（一个可视化界面，可以直接测试 Agent）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,3,0"><b>完美支持流式输出</b>（Streaming），这对于 AI 对话体验至关重要。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="3">以下是将之前的 Agent 部署为标准 Web 服务的完整指南。</p><p data-path-to-node="4"></p><h3>1. 环境准备</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="5">你需要安装 LangServe 和 FastAPI web 框架：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-182 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-182 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_353a5703faa39fda&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_14ae1ec1db2c7eb5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQjQI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-182 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-182">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-182 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-182 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_353a5703faa39fda&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_14ae1ec1db2c7eb5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-182"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-182"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-182"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-182">pip install <span class="hljs-string">"langserve[all]"</span> fastapi uvicorn
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="7"></p><h3>2. 服务端代码 (<code>server.py</code>)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="8">我们将创建一个 <code>server.py</code> 文件，把之前定义的 Agent 包装成一个 API 服务。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-183 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-183 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_353a5703faa39fda&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_14ae1ec1db2c7eb5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQjgI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-183 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-183">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-183 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-183 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_353a5703faa39fda&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_14ae1ec1db2c7eb5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-183"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-183"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-183"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-183"><span class="hljs-comment">#!/usr/bin/env python</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> uvicorn
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> fastapi <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> FastAPI
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_openai <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatOpenAI
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_core.tools <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> tool
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langgraph.prebuilt <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> create_react_agent

<span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 定义工具 (和之前一样)</span>
<span class="hljs-meta">@tool</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">get_weather</span>(<span class="hljs-params">city: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span></span>) -&gt; str:</span>
    <span class="hljs-string">"""查询指定城市的实时天气。"""</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-string">"北京"</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> city:
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">"北京今天晴，气温 20 度。"</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">f"暂时没有 <span class="hljs-subst">{city}</span> 的数据。"</span>

tools = [get_weather]

<span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 创建 Agent (LangGraph)</span>
llm = ChatOpenAI(model=<span class="hljs-string">"gpt-4o"</span>, temperature=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)
agent_executor = create_react_agent(llm, tools)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 初始化 FastAPI 应用</span>
app = FastAPI(
    title=<span class="hljs-string">"LangChain Agent API"</span>,
    version=<span class="hljs-string">"1.0"</span>,
    description=<span class="hljs-string">"一个简单的天气查询智能体接口"</span>,
)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 4. 使用 LangServe 添加路由 (核心步骤)</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langserve <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> add_routes

<span class="hljs-comment"># 将 agent_executor 挂载到 /agent 路径下</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># LangServe 会自动识别 LangGraph 对象并生成对应的 API</span>
add_routes(
    app,
    agent_executor,
    path=<span class="hljs-string">"/agent"</span>,
)

<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="hljs-string">"__main__"</span>:
    <span class="hljs-comment"># 启动服务，端口 8000</span>
    print(<span class="hljs-string">"服务已启动..."</span>)
    print(<span class="hljs-string">"API 文档: http://localhost:8000/docs"</span>)
    print(<span class="hljs-string">"Playground (调试界面): http://localhost:8000/agent/playground"</span>)
    uvicorn.run(app, host=<span class="hljs-string">"localhost"</span>, port=<span class="hljs-number">8000</span>)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="10"></p><h3>3. 运行与测试</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="11">在终端运行：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-184 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-184 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_353a5703faa39fda&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_14ae1ec1db2c7eb5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQjwI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-184 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-184">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-184 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-184 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_353a5703faa39fda&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_14ae1ec1db2c