uto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c452331535-190 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c452331535-190"><button _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c452331535-190 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c452331535-190"><span _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="ng-tns-c452331535-190">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c452331535-190"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c452331535-190 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c4287165981="" id="message-content-id-r_6ab519fa5b1f8d24" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4287165981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_6ab519fa5b1f8d24" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">在 LangChain 1.1.0 生态中，这是一个非常容易混淆的点，因为名字看起来很像，但它们代表了<b>两个完全不同的时代的架构设计</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">简单来说：</p><ul data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b><code>create_tool_calling_agent</code> (以及类似的 create_... 方法):</b> 是<b>旧架构</b>。它只制造“大脑”（决策逻辑），你需要把它装进 <code>AgentExecutor</code>（身体）里才能动。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b><code>create_react_agent</code> (LangGraph 版):</b> 是<b>新架构</b>。它直接制造一个完整的“智能体系统”（大脑+身体+记忆），基于图（Graph）运行。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="3">为了彻底讲清楚，我们需要区分三个概念（注意看包名）：</p><p data-path-to-node="4"></p><h3>1. 核心区别对比表</h3><p></p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3151129961="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" class="table-block has-export-button has-scrollbar"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQqQI"><table data-path-to-node="5"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,0,0,0">特性</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0"><code>langchain.agents.create_...</code> (旧/传统)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,0,2,0"><code>langgraph.prebuilt.create_react_agent</code> (新/推荐)</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,0,0"><b>所属包</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0"><code>langchain.agents</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,2,0"><code>langgraph.prebuilt</code></span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,0,0"><b>本质</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,1,0"><b>仅是 Agent 的定义 (Runnable)</b>。它只是一个“决定下一步做什么”的逻辑链。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,2,0"><b>完整的运行图 (CompiledGraph)</b>。它包含了循环逻辑、工具执行、状态管理。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,0,0"><b>运行方式</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,1,0"><b>必须</b>搭配 <code>AgentExecutor</code> 类才能运行。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,2,0"><b>独立运行</b>。它自己就是一个可执行对象 (Runnable)，直接 <code>.invoke()</code>。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,0,0"><b>底层架构</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,1,0">Chain (线性链)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,2,0">Graph (状态机/图)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,0,0"><b>记忆/状态</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,1,0">需要手动传 <code>chat_history</code> 或用 <code>RunnableWithMessageHistory</code> 包装。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,2,0">内置 <code>checkpointer</code>，通过 <code>thread_id</code> 自动管理。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,6,0,0"><b>流式输出</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,6,1,0">较难控制，区分“思考过程”和“最终答案”比较麻烦。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,6,2,0">原生支持 <code>.stream_events</code>，非常清晰地流式输出每一步。</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy table" aria-label="Copy table" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6ab519fa5b1f8d24&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><hr data-path-to-node="6"><p data-path-to-node="7"></p><h3>2. 代码实现模式对比</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="8"></p><h4>模式 A：传统方式 (Old Way)</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="9"><b>特点：分两步走。先造大脑，再造身体。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="10">这种方式下，<code>create_tool_calling_agent</code> 只是把 LLM 和 Prompt 绑在一起，它<b>不会</b>执行工具，它只会输出“我建议调用这个工具”。真正去调用工具的是 <code>AgentExecutor</code>。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-201 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-201 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6ab519fa5b1f8d24&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fa2ec0db05cec425&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQqwI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-201 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-201">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-201 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-201 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6ab519fa5b1f8d24&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fa2ec0db05cec425&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-201"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-201"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-201"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-201"><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain.agents <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> create_tool_calling_agent, AgentExecutor
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_openai <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatOpenAI
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_core.prompts <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatPromptTemplate

<span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 定义大脑 (Agent)</span>
llm = ChatOpenAI(model=<span class="hljs-string">"gpt-4o"</span>)
prompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([
    (<span class="hljs-string">"system"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"你是一个助手"</span>),
    (<span class="hljs-string">"human"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"{input}"</span>),
    (<span class="hljs-string">"placeholder"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"{agent_scratchpad}"</span>), <span class="hljs-comment"># 旧版必须手动写这个占位符</span>
])

<span class="hljs-comment"># 这只是一个 Runnable，它不会循环，也不会执行工具</span>
agent_runnable = create_tool_calling_agent(llm, tools, prompt)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 定义身体 (Executor) - 黑盒</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># 这个 Executor 负责：拿 Agent 的结果 -&gt; 执行工具 -&gt; 把结果塞回 Prompt -&gt; 循环</span>
agent_executor = AgentExecutor(agent=agent_runnable, tools=tools)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 运行</span>
agent_executor.invoke({<span class="hljs-string">"input"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"..."</span>})
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="12"></p><h4>模式 B：LangGraph 方式 (New Way)</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="13"><b>特点：一步到位。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="14"><code>create_react_agent</code> 直接构建了一个基于图的状态机。它内部已经包含了“调用大模型”、“解析结果”、“执行工具”、“循环”的所有节点和边。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-202 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-202 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6ab519fa5b1f8d24&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fa2ec0db05cec425&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrAI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-202 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-202">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-202 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-202 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6ab519fa5b1f8d24&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fa2ec0db05cec425&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-202"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-202"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-202"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-202"><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langgraph.prebuilt <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> create_react_agent
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_openai <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatOpenAI

<span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 直接构建完整系统</span>
llm = ChatOpenAI(model=<span class="hljs-string">"gpt-4o"</span>)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 这个 app 对象已经包含了循环逻辑和执行能力</span>
app = create_react_agent(llm, tools)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 运行 (输入格式变为 messages 列表)</span>
app.invoke({<span class="hljs-string">"messages"</span>: [(<span class="hljs-string">"user"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"..."</span>)]})
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="16"><p data-path-to-node="17"></p><h3>3. 特别避坑指南：名字冲突</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="18">在 LangChain 中，还有一个<b>非常老</b>的方法也叫 <code>create_react_agent</code>，存在于 <code>langchain.agents</code> 包中。</p><ul data-path-to-node="19"><li><p data-path-to-node="19,0,0">❌ <b><code>langchain.agents.create_react_agent</code></b>: 这是<b>初代</b> ReAct 实现，基于纯文本 Prompt 甚至不需要 LLM 支持 Tool Calling。<b>强烈不建议使用</b>，因为它解析文本极其不稳定。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,1,0">✅ <b><code>langgraph.prebuilt.create_react_agent</code></b>: 这是<b>现代</b>实现，基于大模型的 Tool Calling 能力，稳定且强大。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="20"></p><h3>4. 为什么 1.1.0 推荐用 LangGraph 版？</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="21">如果您使用旧的 <code>create_tool_calling_agent</code> + <code>AgentExecutor</code>，您很快会遇到以下瓶颈：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="22"><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,0"><b>想改流程改不动：</b> <code>AgentExecutor</code> 是写死在代码里的 <code>while</code> 循环。如果你想说“如果工具报错了，先不要重试，而是先问问人类”，在旧版里极难实现。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,1,0"><b>调试困难：</b> 旧版是一个黑盒。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,2,0"><b>状态管理痛苦：</b> 需要自己维护历史消息列表。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="23">而 <b>LangGraph 版 (<code>create_react_agent</code>)</b> 本质上是一个图。虽然它是预构建的，但您依然可以在其基础上进行修改，或者干脆参考它的源码拆开来自己写一个 <code>StateGraph</code>，拥有无限的灵活性。</p><p data-path-to-node="24"></p><h3>总结</h3><p></p><ul data-path-to-node="25"><li><p data-path-to-node="25,0,0">如果您看到代码里有 <code>AgentExecutor(...)</code>，那是 <b>LangChain 0.2/0.3 的传统写法</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="25,1,0">如果您看到代码里是 <code>app.invoke({"messages": ...})</code> 且没有 Executor，那是 <b>LangChain 1.1.0 / LangGraph 的写法</b>。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="26"><b>我的建议：</b>
在新项目中，<b>彻底忘掉 <code>AgentExecutor</code> 和 <code>langchain.agents.create_...</code></b>。直接使用 <code>langgraph.prebuilt.create_react_agent</code>。这是未来的标准。</p><p data-path-to-node="27"><b>下一步：</b>
既然我们已经构建并部署好了这个 Python Agent 服务，<b>您需要我为您展示 Java (Spring Boot) 端如何优雅地调用这个 API 吗？</b> 我们可以结合 <code>WebClient</code> 或 <code>RestClient</code> 来实现。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" _nghost-ng-c3206106919="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c623567544-188"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3226180721="" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-196 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3226180721-196 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3226180721-196 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-196"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-196"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163="" class="conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted" id="6