lay: none;"><g><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_1143)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g></g></svg></div></div></bard-avatar><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c623567544-218 has-thoughts is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" class="menu-button-wrapper ng-tns-c623567544-218 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" mat-button="" mattooltip="More" tabindex="0" aria-label="Show more options" data-test-id="more-menu-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button more-button ng-tns-c623567544-218 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-53" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="response-content ng-tns-c623567544-218"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c452331535="" class="ng-tns-c452331535-219 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c452331535-219 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c452331535-219"><button _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c452331535-219 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c452331535-219"><span _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="ng-tns-c452331535-219">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c452331535-219"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c452331535-219 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c4287165981="" id="message-content-id-r_cb0674a9ff67cc3d" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4287165981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_cb0674a9ff67cc3d" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">在 LangChain 1.1.0 的标准库中，<b>并不存在</b> <code>langchain.agents.factory</code> 这个特定的包路径。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">极有可能您是在某些非官方教程、封装库（或者 Java 版 LangChain4j）中看到了类似的命名，或者是对 <b><code>langchain.agents</code> 包下的一系列 <code>create_..._agent</code> 构造函数</b>的统称。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">在 Python 版 LangChain 1.1.0 中，充当您口中“Factory（工厂）”角色的，是 <b><code>langchain.agents.create_tool_calling_agent</code></b>（以及类似的 <code>create_openai_tools_agent</code> 等）。</p><p data-path-to-node="3">让我们来对比一下这个 <b>“构造函数（Factory）”</b> 与 <b>LangGraph 的 <code>create_react_agent</code></b> 之间的核心区别。这是 <b>“造脑（Brain）”</b> 与 <b>“造人（Robot）”</b> 的区别。</p><p data-path-to-node="4"></p><h3>1. 核心定义对比</h3><p></p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3151129961="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" class="table-block has-export-button has-scrollbar"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ1AI"><table data-path-to-node="5"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,0,0,0">特性</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0"><code>create_tool_calling_agent</code> (您指的 Factory)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,0,2,0"><code>langgraph...create_react_agent</code> (LangGraph)</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,0,0"><b>所属包</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0"><code>langchain.agents</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,2,0"><code>langgraph.prebuilt</code></span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,0,0"><b>产出物</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,1,0"><b>Runnable (仅仅是“大脑”)</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,2,0"><b>CompiledGraph (完整的“机器人”)</b></span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,0,0"><b>功能范围</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,1,0"><b>只做决策</b>。它接收上下文，输出“我建议调用工具X”。它<b>不执行</b>工具，也<b>不循环</b>。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,2,0"><b>全流程闭环</b>。它包含：感知 -&gt; 决策 -&gt; <b>执行工具</b> -&gt; 更新记忆 -&gt; <b>循环</b> -&gt; 最终输出。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,0,0"><b>依赖关系</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,1,0">必须搭配 <code>AgentExecutor</code> 才能跑起来。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,2,0">独立运行，自包含。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,0,0"><b>适用场景</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,1,0">当你需要自定义非常复杂的执行逻辑，或者想把这个“大脑”嵌入到其他非 Agent 系统中时。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,2,0">99% 的标准 Agent 开发场景。</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy table" aria-label="Copy table" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_cb0674a9ff67cc3d&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3151129961="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><p data-path-to-node="6"></p><h3>2. 代码层面的直观差异</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="7"></p><h4>A. 使用 Factory (<code>create_tool_calling_agent</code>)</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="8"><b>特点：你需要自己组装“大脑”和“身体”。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="9">这里，<code>create_tool_calling_agent</code> 就是您说的 factory 方法。它只负责把 LLM 和 Prompt 组装成一个能输出 <code>AgentAction</code> 的对象。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-230 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-230 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_cb0674a9ff67cc3d&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_40b840f7184730f2&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ1gI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-230 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-230">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-230 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-230 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_cb0674a9ff67cc3d&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_40b840f7184730f2&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-230"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-230"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-230"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-230"><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain.agents <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> create_tool_calling_agent, AgentExecutor
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_openai <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatOpenAI
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_core.prompts <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatPromptTemplate

<span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 准备组件</span>
llm = ChatOpenAI(model=<span class="hljs-string">"gpt-4o"</span>)
tools = [...] <span class="hljs-comment"># 工具列表</span>
prompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([
    (<span class="hljs-string">"system"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"You are a helper."</span>),
    (<span class="hljs-string">"human"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"{input}"</span>),
    (<span class="hljs-string">"placeholder"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"{agent_scratchpad}"</span>), 
])

<span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 调用 Factory 方法 (造大脑)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># agent_runnable 只是一个"规划者"。它不会真正去查天气，它只会说"去查天气"。</span>
agent_runnable = create_tool_calling_agent(llm, tools, prompt)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 必须装入 Executor (造身体)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># Executor 负责干脏活累活（执行工具、管理循环）</span>
agent_executor = AgentExecutor(agent=agent_runnable, tools=tools)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 4. 运行</span>
agent_executor.invoke({<span class="hljs-string">"input"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"..."</span>})
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="11"></p><h4>B. 使用 LangGraph (<code>create_react_agent</code>)</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="12"><b>特点：出厂即用。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="13">这个方法是一个更高层级的封装工厂，它内部其实已经自动完成了“造大脑”和“造身体”的过程，并用图（Graph）的方式连接了起来。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-231 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-231 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_cb0674a9ff67cc3d&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_40b840f7184730f2&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ1wI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-231 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-231">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-231 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-231 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_cb0674a9ff67cc3d&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_40b840f7184730f2&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4228668850-231"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4228668850-231"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-231"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4228668850-231"><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langgraph.prebuilt <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> create_react_agent
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_openai <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatOpenAI

<span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 直接创建完整体</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># 内部自动处理了 Prompt、Model 绑定、ToolNode 连接</span>
app = create_react_agent(llm, tools)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 直接运行</span>
app.invoke({<span class="hljs-string">"messages"</span>: [(<span class="hljs-string">"user"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"..."</span>)]})
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="15"></p><h3>3. 深度解析：为什么你会混淆？</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="16">在 LangChain 的演进历史中，API 变化非常大，导致概念容易混淆：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="17"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,0,0"><b>Level 1 (最底层):</b> <code>llm.bind_tools(tools)</code></p><ul data-path-to-node="17,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,0,1,0,0">这是最原始的，LLM 知道工具有哪些，但不知道怎么用。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,1,0"><b>Level 2 (您说的 Factory):</b> <code>create_tool_calling_agent</code></p><ul data-path-to-node="17,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,1,1,0,0">这是中间层。它给 LLM 加上了 Prompt 和解析器（OutputParser），让 LLM 能够稳定地输出结构化的“动作指令”。但它依然<b>没有执行能力</b>。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,2,0"><b>Level 3 (执行器/图):</b> <code>AgentExecutor</code> (旧) 或 <code>create_react_agent</code> (新/LangGraph)</p><ul data-path-to-node="17,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,2,1,0,0">这是应用层。它拿到了 Level 2 的指令，真正去运行 Python 函数，拿到结果，再喂回给 LLM。</p></li></ul></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="18"></p><h3>总结</h3><p></p><ul data-path-to-node="19"><li><p data-path-to-node="19,0,0">如果您指的是 <code>langchain.agents</code> 下的那些 <code>create_...</code> 函数：<b>它们是用来创建 Agent 核心逻辑（Runnable）的工厂。</b></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,1,0"><b>LangGraph 的 <code>create_react_agent</code></b>：<b>是用来创建整个 Agent 应用程序（App）的工厂。</b></p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="20"><b>建议：</b>
除非您是在维护 2024 年初的老代码，否则请<b>尽量避免</b>手动使用 <code>create_tool_calling_agent</code> + <code>AgentExecutor</code> 的组合。直接使用 <code>langgraph.prebuilt.create_react_agent</code> 会让您的代码更简洁、更现代，且原生支持流式输出和状态记忆。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="response-footer has-thoughts is-mobile gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" _nghost-ng-c3206106919="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c623567544="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c623567544-218"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3226180721="" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-225 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3226180721-225 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3226180721-225 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-225"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3226180721="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3226180721-225"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507350163="" class="conversation-container mes