an class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="response-content ng-tns-c623567544-255"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c452331535="" class="ng-tns-c452331535-257 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c452331535-257 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c452331535-257"><button _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c452331535-257 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c452331535-257"><span _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="ng-tns-c452331535-257">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c452331535-257"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c452331535-257 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c4287165981="" id="message-content-id-r_b95039230220039d" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4287165981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_b95039230220039d" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个非常高级且符合真实业务场景的需求。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">您遇到的痛点是：<b><code>thread_id</code> 实现了“会话隔离”（Thread Isolation），但也导致了“记忆孤岛”。</b>
默认情况下，线程 A（昨天关于发票的对话）和线程 B（今天关于报销的对话）是互不可见的。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">要实现**“同一用户的跨会话记忆关联”<b>，我们需要引入</b>双层记忆架构**：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b>短期记忆 (Thread Memory):</b> 依靠 <code>checkpointer</code> + <code>thread_id</code>，保存当前对话的上下文（原样保留）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b>长期记忆 (User Profile/Global Memory):</b> 依靠<b>外部存储</b> + <b>动态提示词注入</b>。我们需要将用户在历史会话中的关键信息（画像、偏好、事实）提取出来，存储在一个共享区域，并在开启新会话时“注入”给 Agent。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="4"><p data-path-to-node="5"></p><h3>解决方案核心逻辑</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="6">我们利用 <code>create_react_agent</code> 的 <b><code>state_modifier</code></b> 特性。
在 1.1.0 中，<code>state_modifier</code> 不仅可以是一个静态字符串，还可以是一个<b>函数</b>。
这个函数可以在每次对话开始前运行，我们可以利用它：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0">读取 <code>config</code> 中的 <code>user_id</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0">去数据库查询该用户的“长期画像”。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,2,0">将画像拼接成 System Prompt，塞给 Agent。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="8"></p><h3>完整代码 Demo</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="9">我们将模拟一个**“长期画像存储” (MockDB)**，并演示用户在 <b>Session 1</b> 留下的信息，如何在 <b>Session 2</b> 被自动关联。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-268 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-268 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_b95039230220039d&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_86ddf8dffbcb1a99&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQggM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-268 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-268">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-268 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-268 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_b95039230220039d&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_86ddf8dffbcb1a99&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1