 ng-tns-c452331535-279"><button _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c452331535-279 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c452331535-279"><span _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="ng-tns-c452331535-279">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c452331535-279"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c452331535="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c452331535-279 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2587251704="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c4287165981="" id="message-content-id-r_8268ad54b333cc78" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4287165981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_8268ad54b333cc78" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个非常经典的**“混合语言架构”**场景。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">在这种架构下，通常遵循 <b>“Java 负责写（管理数据），Python 负责读（检索与生成）”</b> 的模式：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b>Java (Spring Boot):</b> 作为业务核心，负责文档上传、解析、切分，<b>调用 Embedding 接口生成向量</b>，并存入数据库。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b>Python (LangChain):</b> 作为 AI 服务，接收用户问题，<b>去同一个数据库检索向量</b>，并进行回答。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="3">下面为您分别展示 <b>Milvus</b> 和 <b>PostgreSQL (pgvector)</b> 在这种架构下的具体配置与实现。</p><hr data-path-to-node="4"><p data-path-to-node="5"></p><h3>方案一：使用 Milvus (高性能、独立部署)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="6">适合数据量大、追求检索速度、希望计算与存储分离的场景。</p><p data-path-to-node="7"></p><h4>1. 部署 Milvus (Docker Compose)</h4><p></p><p data-path-to-node="8">在服务器上运行：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-308 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4228668850-308 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_8268ad54b333cc78&quot;,&quot;c_48fc01a043422523&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fbb32b28a30e2273&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjOvqTL3ZaRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsAM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4228668850-308 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="ng-tns-c4228668850-308">YAML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4228668850-308 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4228668850="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4228668850-308 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot